    intros p1 j1 E1.
    exact (firex_0RB0LB_0RC1LD_1LB1RC_0RA1LA [SRotL 1; SWin 7; SCycL 3 0; SWin 2; SWinL 3] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

